    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n25046" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Ischŏmăchē</span></b> ,
			ēs, f., = <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἰσχομάχη,</span>
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>the daughter of
				Atracius</i> or <i>Atrax;</i> called also <i>Hippodamīa</i>, <i>at whose
				wedding with Pirithoüs the conflict arose between the
				Centaurs and Lapithæ</i>, <i><span class="en">Prop. 2, 2,
				9</span></i>.</div>
